      "content": "it just feels like there isnt a \"future\" to look forward to. everything is just a loop of survival. sometimes i just sit there thinking about how much easier it would be if i just... stopped. if i could just find a way to make the noise and the weight just go quiet. like, if i wasn't here, at least the pressure would finally be gone.",
